[size=6][b]MapExtension_Plugin[/b][/size]

[size=4][b]About This Mod[/b][/size]

MapExtension_Plugin adds a [b]logistics map inside StarRupture[/b].

Press [b]F8[/b] in game to open a map panel drawn on the game's own map terrain. It shows your cargo network, teleporters, players, base cores, monoliths, antennas, resources and the rupture cycle, all read live from your current session.

The goal is simple: [b]make your world easier to read[/b] once your base and transport setup become harder to follow.

[b]New in 0.8:[/b] the map now lives in the game. The browser page ([b]MapExtensionViewer.html[/b]) is no longer part of the mod.

